# SCENARIO: b7_realism_setup   SEED: 0   CAMERAS: none   BOTCFG: auto
# Batch 7 realism wave setup: `reload debug` and the audit settings are GLOBAL, so the parallel realism
# scenarios (b7_27_bed_sleep, b7_104_rescue_hidden, b7_9_rope_shovel, b7_105_convo_owner) share ONE pin
# set and ONE audit configuration. Pinned bots get no autonomous tasks, which keeps A and B idle next to
# the talking player in b7_105. Teardown: b7_realism_teardown.steps.
# Run: runner.py b7_realism_setup.steps --var BOT=.. --var R=.. --var V=.. --var A=.. --var B=..
@srv cmd _global "reload debug,$BOT;$R;$V;$A;$B" timeout=120
@srv sleep 25
@srv audit kinds probe,path,pathout,state,hib,wake,cmd
@srv audit watch $BOT
@srv audit watch $R
@srv audit watch $V
@srv audit on expect="enabled=on"
@srv cmd "$BOT" status expect="state="
@srv cmd "$R" status expect="state="
@srv cmd "$V" status expect="state="
@srv cmd "$A" status expect="state="
@srv cmd "$B" status expect="state="
